Not a bad choice, but if I were you, I would consider:

1) a blessed figurine of a Solar - Slashem only.  Tough enough to kill
Master Kaen for you. Make sure you have a magic whistle or blessed leaf
before you get this, and have a cockatrice/basilisk egg ready in case
you hit the chance of getting a hostile Solar.

2) an amulet of unchanging. - allows you to stay in crystal golem form
permanently.

3) A wand of polymorph - polypiling is not as useful anymore, but it
still can be great for collecting spells and immediate use
potions/scrolls.

The useful spells you should know include:
1) Charm Monster
2) Haste self
3) Identify
4) magic mapping

Lets talk medium-term strategy now.  At this stage, you should be
getting ready to do the quest.  The best place to stock up for this is
at the Black Market.  As a doppelganger, you have an ideal way of
robbing the BM of everything you can carry.  So here is the plan:

Find the portal to the Black Market.
Create an Elbereth-protected cache next to the portal
Put your heavy stuff into the cache.
Enter the BM and quaff a blessed potion of object detection.
Collect and bless all of the Identify scrolls in the market.
Use these scrolls to identify all unknown items in the market.
Collect ALL useful items (all potions, scrolls, wands, spellbooks,
artifacts, magical armor, tools, rings, amulets, etc.)
Sell your identified gems to get all of Sam's gold, then get your gems
again.
Be VERY careful not to have a BoHolding explosion or trapped chest
accident.
Polymorph into a xorn, and exit the market from the upper corner
directly into the portal.

For the quest, you have a few options.  Have you learned how to use the
"chained blitz" technique yet?

